## Project Specification

This repository is an OSRS hiscore ingestion and reporting system with:

1. Snapshot ingestion from Jagex hiscore endpoints
2. Deterministic JSON snapshot persistence
3. Markdown report generation from payloads/deltas
4. Existing FastAPI web UI (separate from Council web UI)
5. Council custom page integration under `.council/web/`

### Core Components

| Component | Purpose | Primary Paths |
|-----------|---------|---------------|
| Snapshot pipeline | Fetch, normalize, persist, delta | `agents/osrs_snapshot_agent.py`, `core/` |
| Reporting | Render markdown summaries | `agents/report_agent.py`, `core/report_builder.py` |
| Existing app web UI | Profile/clan/dashboard operations | `web/main.py`, `web/routes/`, `web/templates/` |
| API surface | HTTP endpoints for app features | `api/` |
| Council config | Roster, templates, custom pages | `.council/` |

### Data and Output Conventions

1. Snapshots: `data/snapshots/<player>/<YYYYMMDD_HHMMSS>.json`
2. Reports: `reports/<player>/<snapshot_id>.md`
3. Project logging: `.scribe/docs/dev_plans/<project>/PROGRESS_LOG.md`

