## Council Web UI Bridge Workflow

When integrating this repo with Council custom pages:

1. Add page templates in `.council/web/pages/*.html.j2`
2. Add page assets in `.council/web/static/css|js|img`
3. Map page paths to agent defaults in `.council/council.yaml` under `council.chat.page_agents`
4. Keep standalone web UI (`web/`) and Council custom pages logically separate
5. Put repeatable integration guidance in templates, not generated docs

